---
globs: **/*.sql,**/*.psql
alwaysApply: false
---
# SQL

- Target the project’s actual SQL dialect (SQLite/MySQL/PostgreSQL); do not mix syntax across dialects.
- Prefer explicit columns over `SELECT *` (unless clearly safe).
- Add pagination/limits for queries that could return large result sets.
- Note index implications when adding filters/joins on large tables.
- Make migrations additive and reversible when possible.
